...@../../_tools/theme
shape: sequence_diagram

user: 사용자 { class: person }
script: 스크립트 (main) { class: ours }
wfgen: WorkFlowGenerator { class: ours }
openai: OpenAI gpt-4o-mini { class: ext }
verify: CodeVerification { class: ours }
anthropic: Anthropic Claude { class: ext }
wf: WorkFlow { class: ours }

user -> script: python ai_Self-Evolving_agent.py
script -> wfgen: generate_workflow(goal)
wfgen -> openai: 목표 분해 요청
openai -> wfgen: 워크플로우 그래프(JSON)
wfgen -> script: workflow_graph
script -> wf: execute()
wf -> openai: 실행 요청
openai -> wf: 생성된 코드(HTML)
wf -> script: output
script -> verify: execute(requirements, code)
verify -> anthropic: 코드+요구사항
anthropic -> verify: verified_code
verify -> script: verified_code
script -> script: index.html로 저장
